<h3>Choosing a Reward Option</h3>
<p>All three Reward Options are available simultaneously. A valid Affiliate Link referral with no Code uses Reward Option A; the 5% Affiliate Code uses Reward Option B; and the 10% Affiliate Code uses Reward Option C. A Code applied to an order overrides the Link, and no confirmation is required to use a different route for a later referral.</p>
